<title>UK: LB Schleswig-Holstein adds $100mln to Jun2000 bond. [CORRECTED 11:40 GMT]</title>
<headline>LB Schleswig-Holstein adds $100mln to Jun2000 bond. [CORRECTED 11:40 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased by lead manager Paribas Capital Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LB SCHLESWIG-HOLSTEIN</p>
<p> AMT   *$300 MLN	COUPON     6.0 PCT   MATURITY    12.JUN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.35    PAY DATE  **13.JAN.96</p>
<p>(Corrects payment date from December 12.)</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.95     SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	*ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR $200 MLN ON 13.NOV.96</p>
<p>		**PLUS 31 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING     LUX	 GOV LAW    ENGLISH</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT   YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
